## 🗼 Chart finder

| You want to show… | Use |
|---|---|
| Trend over time | `plot({'A': [...]}, x=..., type='line')` or `errorband` |
| Comparison across categories | `type='bar'` / `'grouped'` / `'compare'` |
| Part-to-whole | `type='pie'` / `'donut'` / `'treemap'` / `'sunburst'` / `'waffle'` |
| Distribution of one variable | `type='hist'` / `'box'` / `'violin'` / `'ridgeline'` / `'distpanel'` |
| Relationship between two variables | `type='scatter'` / `'bubble'` / `'hexbin'` / `'pairs'` |
| Correlation of many variables | `plot(df, type='correlation')` / `heatmap` |
| Model quality | `type='confusion'` / `'roc'` / `'residual'` / `'validation'` / `'learning'` |
| Sensitivity / importance | `type='sensitivity'` / `'importance'` |
| Optimization | `type='surface'` / `'contour'` / `'pareto'` / `'trace'` |
| ODEs & dynamics | `type='vector'` / `'phase'` |
| Flows & processes | `type='sankey'` / `'flow'` / `'funnel'` / `'gantt'` |
| Rankings over time | `type='bump'` / `'slope'` |
| Hierarchy | `type='sunburst'` / `'icicle'` / `'treemap'` / `'dendrogram'` |
| Paper summary figure | `panel_figure([...])` / `type='dashboard'` / `'radar'` |
| Prediction & forecast | `type='forecast'` (history + band) / `'pred_actual'` |
| Model selection (clustering / PCA) | `type='elbow'` / `'silhouette'` / `'scree'` |
| Calculus teaching figures | `type='integral'` / `'riemann'` / `'tangent'` / `'spline'` |
| Hypothesis testing | `type='ttest'` with shaded rejection region |
| Inequality / concentration | `type='gini'` (Lorenz curve) |
| Evaluation-model papers (AHP/TOPSIS) | `type='ahp'` 层次结构图 |
| Chaos & iterative maps | `type='bifurcation'` / `'cobweb'` |
| Simulation chapters | `type='montecarlo'` (running mean + CI) |
| Time-series diagnostics | `type='acf'` / `'decomposition'` |
| Correlation structure | `type='corr_network'` / `clustermap` |
| Accessibility check | `cvd_preview()` + `colorblind_safe()` |
| Which fit model is best | `type='model_comparison'` (R²-ranked) |
| Compare classifier models | `type='multi_roc'` / `'lift'` / calibration |
| Scenario best/base/worst | `type='scenario'` (range plot) |
| Daily data over a year | `type='calendar'` |
| Variable loadings | `type='pca_biplot'` |
| Two-sample distribution shift | `type='kstest'` (D-stat marked) |
| Config/LLM-driven figures | `render_spec({...})` / `mmv spec recipe.json` |
| Effect sizes with CI | `type='forest'` (meta-analysis style) |
| Which factors matter most | `type='vital_few'` (Pareto chart) |
| Does A lead or lag B | `type='lead_lag'` (cross-correlation) |
| Three-component mixtures | `type='ternary'` |
| Scatter + marginal spread | `type='jointplot'` |
| Robust trend in noise | `type='lowess'` / `'savgol'` |
| One-click look & palette | `apply_theme('colorblind')` |
| Rank candidates visually | `type='cleveland'` (dot plot) |
| Fold-change vs significance | `type='volcano'` |
| Cluster spread & separation | `type='ellipses'` (1σ/2σ) |
| Solution vs a parameter | `type='sweep'` (colored curve family) |
| ODE flow + integrated orbits | `type='phase_diagram'` |
| Control vs treatment per category | `type='half_violin'` |
| Probability × impact map | `type='riskmap'` |
| Environment diagnostics | `mmv doctor` |
| Every observation, zero overlap | `type='beeswarm'` (box overlay optional) |
| Process stability / SPC | `type='spc'` (CL/UCL/LCL + violations) |
| OHLC price/envelope data | `type='ohlc'` |
| Policy vs baseline delta | `type='difference_band'` (max gap marked) |
| Multi-page appendix PDF | `pdf_report(figs, 'appendix.pdf', title=...)` |
| Flow / migration matrix | `type='chord'` |
| Correlations with p-values | `correlation_matrix(df, show_significance=True, n_obs=...)` |
| Start a report project | `mmv init` |
| Render many JSON specs | `mmv batch specs/ -o output/` |
| The best distribution plot | `type='cloud'` (raincloud) |
| Part-to-whole bubbles | `type='packed_circles'` |
| Sequence hand-offs | `type='arcgraph'` |
| Project-wide look defaults | `.mmvrc.json` (auto-loaded) |

## 🏆 Competition paper guide (CUMCM / MCM-ICM)

| Section | Figures | Chart types |
|---|---|---|
| 摘要 / Summary sheet | 1–2 | `dashboard`, `radar` |
| 问题重述 / Problem restatement | 1 | `mind`, `flow` |
| 模型建立 / Model formulation | 2–3 | `network`, `flow`, `surface`, `contour` |
| 模型求解 / Solving | 2–3 | `line`, `learning`, `trace`, `phase` |
| 结果分析 / Results | 4–6 | `bar`, `grouped`, `correlation`, `scatter`, `distpanel` |
| 灵敏度分析 / Sensitivity | 1–2 | `sensitivity`, `importance` |
| 模型检验 / Validation | 1–2 | `residual`, `confusion`, `errorband` |
| 结论 / Conclusion | 1 | `radar`, `dashboard`, `panel` |

**Style picks** — CUMCM: `apply_style('nature')`; MCM/ICM: `apply_style('publication')`; posters: `'poster'`; slides in a dark room: `'dark'`.
**Palette picks** — papers: `nature_qual` (default) or `tol_8` (colorblind-safe); dark mode: `palette='dark_mode', style='dark'`.

## 🎨 Styles & palettes

```python
from plot import apply_style, get_palette, auto_colors, list_styles

apply_style('economist')                       # global preset
colors = auto_colors(5, 'viridis')             # 5 sequential colors
pal    = get_palette('nature_qual')            # full qualitative palette
```

Browse everything from the terminal:

```bash
mmv styles      # 7 style presets
mmv palettes    # 30+ palettes with ANSI color swatches
```

## ⚡ Performance

- **Large line data**: above 20 000 points per series, min/max decimation preserves peaks while drawing ~10× faster — visually identical output.
- **Vectorized colormaps**: palette interpolation is numpy-based (was a Python loop).
- **Style caching**: repeated `apply_style('nature')` calls are no-ops.
- **Headless-safe**: servers/CI without a display automatically fall back to the Agg backend instead of crashing in Tk/Qt.

